% expect-error: rangecheck
% Scenario: an uncoloured pattern without a base. The current pattern
% space has no underlying space to take the components in, so
% setpattern with an uncoloured instance is rangecheck (PLRM3 section
% 8.2, setpattern) and nothing is painted.
/U << /PatternType 1 /PaintType 2 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 10 /YStep 10 /PaintProc { pop 0 0 5 5 rectfill } >> matrix makepattern def
[/Pattern] setcolorspace
0.5 U setpattern
100 100 200 100 rectfill
showpage
